OL,3,GNEWSAOver-70s share their winter
OL,4,Asurvival tips
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor 72-year-old Jen Morgan, the thought
OL,7,Fof catching flu this winter would be
OL,8,F"an absolute disaster".
OL,10,FLiving alone for the first time in her
OL,11,Flife and managing heart problems, she
OL,12,Fis among older people in Bristol
OL,13,Fsharing the habits they believe help
OL,14,Fkeep them well through the colder
OL,15,Fmonths.
OL,17,FTheir advice comes as NHS South West
OL,18,Furges eligible people to get flu and
OL,19,FCovid vaccinations and take steps to
OL,20,Fprotect their health amid rising winter
OL,21,Fpressures.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
